# NEXA AI assistant — all optional. Without these, the app runs entirely in
# NEXA's built-in demo mode (see src/lib/nexaMock.js), which is fully
# functional and requires no configuration.
#
# SECURITY WARNING: setting VITE_NEXA_AI_API_KEY bundles that key into
# client-side JavaScript, visible to anyone who opens dev tools. Only do
# this for local experimentation. For a real deployment, proxy the request
# through your own backend instead and never ship a private key to the
# browser.

# VITE_NEXA_AI_API_KEY=
# VITE_NEXA_AI_BASE_URL=https://api.openai.com/v1/chat/completions
# VITE_NEXA_AI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
